**Trace (optional · 可选).** At phase boundaries, append machine-readable facts — `gate_miss` or
`human_correction` — to `.harness/traces.jsonl`, one JSON line each:
`{"v":1,"ts":"…","project":"…","task":"…","harness":"…","event":"gate_miss"}`. At task close, record
one final `task_outcome` line carrying the verdict's source and value —
`{"v":1,"ts":"…","project":"…","task":"…","harness":"…","event":"task_outcome","detail":{"judge":"human","score":4,"rubric":"…"},"session":"…"}`
(`judge` is `human` or `machine`; a machine judge is only legitimate where the task family has a
defined metric). A human runs `harness collect --project .` to pull them back to the factory
(offline, never automatic).
